  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Band stops to cheer on a fight in the audience**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Golden Eal**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **All of My Love**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Rock & Roll**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Rock & Roll**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2003-11-10** (recommended): audience recording; 37 songs; 167 min [1]. Said about its sound: Recording is somewhat fuzzy but still sounds pretty good overall; uploader estimates roughly B+ to A; There is a gap in the recording: it cuts out at a Cinco de Mayo mention and resumes at a line about mama in the night [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2003-11-10**: source: AUD [1]. Also: Uploader retracked some songs because the original seed had two or three songs per track [1]",
